Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:53:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] kanban sync links pass: time failed boards and name
 slow-but-unchanged boards

A board's links-pass failure warning now carries 'failed after <s>s' (a slow failure is a lock/busy wait, the case
the duration logging exists for), and a board skipped as unchanged after an inputs read of LINKS_SLOW_LOG_S or more
logs '<board> chat links unchanged, skipped in <s>s' instead of only the unnamed whole-pass line.

The skip decision moves into _links_unchanged (reconcile_links NESTING cap), and the pure _ledger_slices and
_links_signature move to kanban_sync_links_inputs.py (kanban_sync_client.py FILE_LINES cap), re-imported under
their old names. PR #2007 review nits (t_01a1d40f42f110be); card t_01a1d4125b4a125d.
